'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[medium armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Issued to all [[Helldiver]]s.

==Passive Ability==
{{Armor Passive Info Panel|Extra Padding}}

==Lore==
The true successor to [[Helldivers 1:Armor#Tactical|Mk-5 Tactical]] from ''[[Helldivers 1]]'', which was modernized as [[DP-00 Tactical|DP-00]]. The [[Helldivers 1:Armor#Next-Gen|Mk-1b Next-Gen]] design closely resembles '''B-01'''.

